            <ArticleTitle>Progressive anticonvulsant hypersensitivity syndrome associated with change of drug product.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>428-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/j.1600-0404.2007.00976.x</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report describes the laboratory and physical manifestations of lamotrigine-like toxicity in a young man with refractory epilepsy receiving lamotrigine presenting as anticonvulsant hypersensitivity syndrome (AHS) associated with an abrupt change of drug product.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
